{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんにちわかつき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/21/4312620/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は待ちに待った"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"横浜アリーナでの"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂46 バースデーライブ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ついにやってきました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"色んな意味で心が震えてます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"去年は幕張メッセでの1周年"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今年は横浜アリーナでの2周年"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1年越しの今日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"曲も倍になり、時間も長くなり、なにより去年より大きな会場でやらせていただけることに感謝しています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誕生日は、一般的には生まれた人が周りから祝ってもらう日。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、私は誕生日は産んでくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"親に感謝する日だと思っています。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私達を育ててくれた"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木坂familyへの感謝のライブなのです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんにありがとうを。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"